  message: "FIXED in PR #1313 (merged, dev 79ac9444c4): _taint_blind_reason scopes the supported-language set with the edges. Re-ran the filed repro on merged dev: python + go repo, --taint-sources declaring build_input for python only, claim build_input must not reach host_fs -> confirmed rc 0 (was inconclusive rc 2, 'supported language(s) go ... produced no call edges'). Pinned by core test_taint_blind_claim_scope.py::test_a_supported_language_outside_the_scope_does_not_block and lang test test_a_label_declared_only_in_python_does_not_count_go; mutation-checked. Corpus A/B: hypergumbo's own 18 project-label self-claims unchanged (inconclusive on opaque subprocess launches before this gate)."  # ba75
